  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651512b2efd40cb1167699ef-b33a8f59.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt, and bring to the boil. Stir in jasmine rice, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 12 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 12 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651512b2efd40cb1167699ef-2d7214db.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 mins remaining, drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add tomato paste, remaining garlic, jerk seasoning and lentils and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add coconut milk and water (for the sauce).\n• Simmer until thickened, 2-3 mins. Stir in roasted veggies. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651512b2efd40cb1167699ef-91aa8cf2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and lentils between bowls. Top with yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651512b2efd40cb1167699ef-bd0b72b6.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
